<title>HONG KONG: Nomura Int'l sets warrants on Paliburg.</title>
<headline>Nomura Int'l sets warrants on Paliburg.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura International (Hong Kong) Ltd said on Tuesday it intended to launch 650 million American-style call warrants on shares of Paliburg Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$7.45	   PREMIUM     24.5 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.182525     GEARING     4.08x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  07.JUL.98	 REFERENCE SPOT    HK$7.45</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY OF SHARES AT</p>
<p>			 ISSUER'S DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
